## One logical task per session

Keep the context clean. After roughly two failed attempts at the same problem, clear the session
and restart with a better prompt that incorporates what was learned -- grinding in a polluted
context does not converge.

Compact before a long session hits its limit, and aim the summary at the API shape and the
decisions, not the narrative.

